### US-8.1 slice A walkthrough. Dev security (local profile): no token needed.
@app = http://localhost:8080
@wiremock = http://localhost:8089

### 1. Run v1 (api1 -> api2 -> api3 -> api5)
POST {{app}}/api/v1/pipelines/DEMO_ONBOARD/runs?mode=sync
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Asha Rao", "pan": "ABCDE1234F"}

### 2. Timeline of that run (set runId from the response above)
GET {{app}}/api/v1/runs/{{runId}}/timeline?include=events

### 3a. Reorder: save v2 as the draft. Paste the content of
###     src/main/resources/seed/DEMO_ONBOARD.v2-reordered.json as "definition".
###     If a draft already exists, add "If-Match: <its ETag>" (GET …/draft returns it), or the PUT is 428.
PUT {{app}}/api/v1/admin/pipelines/DEMO_ONBOARD/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{"definition": {}}

### 3b. Publish v2: no redeploy
POST {{app}}/api/v1/admin/pipelines/DEMO_ONBOARD/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment": "business reorder: notify before scoring"}

### 3c. Run again: version 2, /welcome before /scores
POST {{app}}/api/v1/pipelines/DEMO_ONBOARD/runs?mode=sync
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Asha Rao", "pan": "ABCDE1234F"}

### 4a. A broken reorder: paste src/main/resources/seed/DEMO_ONBOARD.invalid-reorder.json as "definition"
PUT {{app}}/api/v1/admin/pipelines/DEMO_ONBOARD/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{"definition": {}}

### 4b. Publish it: 422 FORWARD_REFERENCE
POST {{app}}/api/v1/admin/pipelines/DEMO_ONBOARD/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. KYC flaky (503, 503, 200): the next run still completes, with 3 attempts on api2
PUT {{wiremock}}/__admin/scenarios/kyc/state
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "flaky"}

### 6a. KYC down (always 503): after five failures the circuit opens
PUT {{wiremock}}/__admin/scenarios/kyc/state
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "down"}

### 6b. Circuit state on this node
GET {{app}}/api/v1/admin/endpoints/kyc-svc/circuit

### 6c. Back to normal
PUT {{wiremock}}/__admin/scenarios/kyc/state
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "Started"}

### 6d. Reset the circuit
POST {{app}}/api/v1/admin/endpoints/kyc-svc/circuit/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "KYC back"}
